[ti:Ra a]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:17.56]Ra... a... a... a...
[00:31.89]Mere yaar...
[00:36.67]Dekh mere yaar, yu... sapne mein aana chhod de..
[00:41.45]Rahya nahi jaave, mane yu satana chhod de..
[00:55.79]He Ra a a a, mere yaar pyaare,
[01:00.57]He Ra a a a..., dildaar pyaare,
[01:05.35]Tere sang sootre laage,
[01:10.12]Laage ambar saje sitare,,
[01:14.90]He Ra Ra Ra Ra.. Ra...
[01:29.24]Ambar kalgi tere dheer ki,
[01:34.02]Bas tu bharosa jodh de......
[01:43.58]Nahi toh ra jaan ke pyaare, yun satana chhod de,,
[01:48.36]Dekh mere yaar, sapne mein aana chhod de,,
[01:53.13]Jeen de tu maine, yun raatein thaana chhod de,,,
[02:12.25]Kade ya kahaani teri, mere sang bahi paave,
[02:17.03]Dhoonk ya bhitar ki, tan kha jaave,
[02:21.81]Kha jaave aatma ke, dheeramdheer ne,
[02:26.59]Maati ka kaal re bande... Maati ke ameer ne..
[02:36.14]Laage yu duppta.. kaatilana chhod de,
[02:40.92]Mane mere pyaar, yun satana chhod de,
[02:45.70]Dekh mere yaar sapne mein aana chhod de,
[03:00.04]Tohi jaaun tane main sabke hi beech mein,
[03:04.82]Phirun main chamakta, is pher kheech mein,
[03:09.60]Tere te toh mil lyun, aankhein meech meech mein,
[03:19.15]Titli के pankha mein tu, aangli के tanka mein tu,
[03:23.93]Mere saare anka mein tu, khet mein tu, kanka mein tu,
[03:38.27]Jeth mahine mein deh sulgana chhod de..
[03:43.05]Jeen de tu mane sapne mein aana chhod de...
[03:52.60]Mit jaunga main saara, tu roj meetana chhod de..
[04:02.16]Chhod de na mere yaar......
